end
if not LIGHT then run_h103() end


-- ============================================================================
-- HARNESS 104 - TWO ITEMS
--
-- ITEM 1, THE USER'S NURGLING TIDE THEORY ("the ability takes around 4 seconds
--   to activate and the guard is only 2, so it re-issues and cancels the
--   previous order"). The data: Nurgling Tide's own row declares wind_up_time
--   3.0 s, no activation_effect, no phase row - the order-to-effect window is
--   3 s, and the user's ~4 s is that window plus delivery. Both exceed the 2 s
--   guard. The fix under test: after a successful cast, a pair whose ability
--   declares a wind-up is held for wind_up + 2 s (IN_FLIGHT_SETTLE_SECONDS),
--   never less than the guard. The charge gate STAYS.
--   I1 proves the hold with an ability whose 3 s activation outlasts the old
--   2 s guard: death_frenzy (wind_up 3.0 s, ONE use, so the charge gate cannot
--   mask the result). The pre-104 build fires at ticks 1/9/17; the fixed build
--   fires at 1 and then not before tick 21 (5 s).
--
-- ITEM 2, STAR OF AVELORN. A ground-targeted group heal (target_ground +
--   target_ground_under_allies, effect_range 15 m, up to 3 friendly units) that
--   only fired when the CASTER was below 75%, at her own feet. The fix: the
--   health family is ally-aware - fire when this unit OR a friendly unit inside
--   the ability's own reach is at or below 75%, choose the LOWEST-health unit,
--   and cast under THAT unit's ground. The reach is the standing 70% rule:
--   floor(15 * 0.70) = 10 m for Star of Avelorn, floor(35 * 0.70) = 24 m for
--   Gulyas / Salyak's Lullaby, floor(55 * 0.70) = 38 m for Locus of Fecundity;
--   the friend-targeted forms use floor(target_intercept_range * 0.70).
--   S1-S11 prove: ally arm fires at the ally's position, silence with no hurt
--   ally, silence beyond the aura, the owner arm still fires, the lowest-health
--   unit wins, Gulyas' 24 m aura, the self-centred aura stays a self cast, a
--   friend-targeted heal targets the ally, a routing ally is not offered, and a
--   chosen ally that drifts out of reach is re-checked and skipped.
--
-- PINS: the table stays 675 entries; ushoran_health drops 33 -> 20 and the 13
--   moved entries ride the three new triggers (2 ground / 9 ally / 2 self).
--   The older suites' own count gates are updated HERE (never in the old files).
--
-- RED CONTROL (H106_LIVE/H106_ANN -> docs/backups/round103/*.pre103.lua):
--   I1 fires three times and S1-S11 stay silent, while every harness-103 world
--   still passes.
-- ============================================================================
function run_h104()
  local live_src104 = read_file(LIVE)
  local ann_src104  = read_file(ANN)
  local NURG = "wh3_main_lord_abilities_nurgling_tide"
  local STAR = "wh2_dlc10_item_abilities_star_of_avelorn"
  local GUL  = "wh3_dlc24_lord_abilities_gulyas"
  local SAL  = "wh3_main_character_abilities_salyaks_lullaby"
  local BERRY = "wh2_dlc16_item_abilities_berry_wine"
